                                "sense_id": "47a9eec4-e8a9-3404-9635-71ea8156d7c1",
                                "text": "It is important to note, here, that we are not thinking of social production only in terms of political economy at this point, so that social production includes exchanges, circulations, consumings, refusals, and reproducings of all kinds, and that social[…]"
                            },
                            {
