                                "sense_id": "47a9eec4-e8a9-3404-9635-71ea8156d7c1",
                                "text": "Understanding why a correlation persists, what kind of endurings or cyclings or reproducings are accounting for it, can of course be a huge help in trying to project the more exact path or paths that a correlation will take, hence in reading signs."
